{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Box Breathing Minimal Timer 是一款以方形呼吸法為核心的引導練習工具，適合工作壓力大、難以專注或睡前思緒紛亂的人使用。它以簡潔的視覺動畫帶領吸氣、屏息、呼氣與再次屏息的節奏，協助建立穩定的呼吸習慣。原價 US $0.99，目前限時免費。</p>\n<img alt=\"限時免費\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460bb-75-176.webp\">\n<h2>方形呼吸引導與自訂節奏</h2>\n<p>開啟程式後，畫面會以一個持續擴張與收縮的方塊，配合吸氣、屏息、呼氣及再次屏息四個階段，讓使用者自然跟上節奏。吸氣、屏息與呼氣的秒數均可自行調整，以配合不同程度的練習經驗。程式提供柔和的配色、淺色與深色模式，亦可選擇聲音或震動提示輔助跟隨。整體設計簡約、沒有廣告干擾，適合在繁忙工作中抽一分鐘沉澱，或睡前放鬆身心。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-310-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-311-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-312-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-313-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-314-scaled.jpg\">\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Box Breathing Minimal Timer</li>\n<li>應用類別：Health &amp; Fitness</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T15:40:13.346344+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":370,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-16T15:31:59+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-17T16:18:02.516379+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T15:37:45.544106+00:00","content_hash":"fa93fd86aa6d584efbe1bbe6ae9c1b04f3f56883661a0daae1fcfd688f94da18","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}